{"kind":"pr","url":"https://github.com/foundry-rs/foundry/pull/14920","repo":"foundry-rs/foundry","number":14920,"set":"agent","source":"amp","title":"feat(symbolic): cache solver models","body":"## Motivation\nThe symbolic executor already caches satisfiability checks, but model extraction can repeat the same solver work for equivalent query environments. This adds a small bounded cache for validated models to reduce redundant solver calls on repeated/normalized queries.\n\n## Solution\n- Add a bounded solver model cache alongside the existing SAT cache.\n- Normalize model-cache keys so equivalent hard arithmetic/query shapes can reuse validated model results.\n- Add focused tests for cache hits, eviction, validation, and normalized-key reuse.\n\n## Testing\n- `cargo test -p foundry-evm-symbolic --lib`\n- `cargo clippy -p foundry-evm-symbolic --all-targets -- -D warnings`\n- `cargo test -p forge symbolic_conformance -- --nocapture`\n- `cargo test -p forge symbolic_engine_capabilities -- --nocapture`\n\nThread: https://ampcode.com/threads/T-019e3bf2-923d-727e-82f5-40ca3e956694","authorType":"User","additions":34172,"deletions":85,"changedFiles":77,"files":[{"path":"Cargo.lock","additions":20,"deletions":0},{"path":"Cargo.toml","additions":2,"deletions":0},{"path":"crates/cheatcodes/src/crypto.rs","additions":6,"deletions":27},{"path":"crates/cheatcodes/src/json.rs","additions":1,"deletions":1},{"path":"crates/common/Cargo.toml","additions":1,"deletions":1},{"path":"crates/common/src/lib.rs","additions":1,"deletions":0},{"path":"crates/common/src/traits.rs","additions":19,"deletions":1},{"path":"crates/common/src/wallet.rs","additions":68,"deletions":0},{"path":"crates/config/src/inline/mod.rs","additions":114,"deletions":17},{"path":"crates/config/src/inline/natspec.rs","additions":397,"deletions":4},{"path":"crates/config/src/lib.rs","additions":50,"deletions":0},{"path":"crates/config/src/providers/warnings.rs","additions":31,"deletions":0},{"path":"crates/config/